 "what_it_is": "Phase modulation added by the RECEIVER (BB60): period exactly 1168 samples at 5 MS/s (4280.82 Hz) plus its 2nd harmonic, phase FIXED to the capture start. Measured on every radio and both capture sessions: phase identical across sessions days apart (R >= 0.999); level changes 0.8-2.4 dB between a radio's two sessions and does not follow the radio (cross-session correlation -0.54..-0.03), so one fleet value per config.",
 "model": "phi(n) = sum_h amps_rad[h] * sin(2 pi h n / 1168 + phases_rad[h]), h = 1, 2; n = capture sample index from 0. Applied before the anti-alias filter.",
 "estimator": "rx_spur.estimate_rx_spur (data-aided, self-referencing on the burst average). Round trip: 1.4 deg recovered within 1-2%, 0.25 deg within 8-16% (low); floor 0.02-0.05 deg.",
